  <aside class="cns" aria-label="Ways to reach us">
    <div class="cns-r"><span class="cns-i"><span data-au-icon="mail" data-grad></span></span><div><b>Email us</b><small>General questions, sales and partnerships</small><span class="cns-e"><a href="mailto:support@nxeon.cloud">support@nxeon.cloud</a><button type="button" id="cn-copy">Copy</button></span></div></div>
    <div class="cns-r"><span class="cns-i"><span data-au-icon="server" data-grad></span></span><div><b>Support tickets</b><small>Already a customer? A ticket from your dashboard reaches the on-call team fastest.</small><a class="cns-a" href="/dashboard">Go to dashboard →</a></div></div>
    <div class="cns-r"><span class="cns-i"><span data-au-icon="refresh" data-grad></span></span><div><b>Response time</b><small>We reply to every message within one business day.</small></div></div>
  </aside>
</div></section>

<section class="section cnf-s" aria-labelledby="cf-t"><div class="container">
